  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f867e729cd163844296773769e23f97f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Alexander
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Rarety: 0
  m_Description: "Alexander, the rightful King of Maedonis, is a legend of southern
    lands. Cast away from the throne by his father at a young age, he grew up in
    exile, hardened by the unforgiving world around him. His kingdom, torn by civil
    war and the greed of corrupt nobles, teetered on the brink of ruin. But Alexander,
    with strength surpassing any warrior, rose from the ashes of his past to reclaim
    his birthright. His return was not just a battle for power but a quest to save
    his people from chaos. \\n\\nNow, as the crown rests upon his brow, he stands
    as a beacon of hope and stability. Though a fearsome warrior on the battlefield,
    Alexander\u2019s heart beats for peace. His loyalty lies with the Emperor of
    Humans, to whom he has sworn allegiance to secure his kingdom\u2019s place in
    a world of uncertainty. Yet, his true allegiance is to his people, whom he would
    protect at any cost. Noble in spirit, unwavering in resolve, Alexander rules
    with the strength of a king and the compassion of a guardian, driven by the hope
    of forging a lasting peace for Maedonis."
  AutoAttack: 7
  SpecialAbility: 37
  Ultimate: 8
